  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2024, through this EA, UNRWA will support 425 families, mainly in Dera&apos;a, Ein el Tal and, to a lesser extent, Yarmouk camps, whose homes were damaged (either because of the conflict or the earthquakes) and are in urgent need of minor repairs. In addition, the Agency will pilot major shelter repairs for 100 families in the same locations.</narrative>
